    "title": "-나 보다 (it seems, guessing from evidence)",
    "title_ko": "-나 보다",
    "focus_axis": "grammar"
  },
  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "« -나 보다 » guesses based on visible evidence (it seems that ~). For example, « 길이 막히나 봐요 » (It seems the road is congested, judging from the traffic).",
    "explanation_ko": "'-나 보다'는 보이는 증거를 근거로 추측합니다(~한가 보다). 예: '길이 막히나 봐요'.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "It seems the road is congested.",
        "ko": "길이 막히나 봐요."
      },
      {
        "en": "It seems he is sick, judging from his face.",
        "ko": "얼굴을 보니 아프나 봐요."
      },
      {
        "en": "It seems it's going to rain, judging from the sky.",
        "ko": "하늘을 보니 비가 오려나 봐요."
      }
    ]
  },
